# Cloudflare Pages redirects/rewrites
# Serve the English homepage content directly at the root URL with HTTP 200
# (no redirect hop: PSI/Lighthouse measured 0.92 vs 0.99 performance through
# the previous 301 — the extra round trip cost the difference on slow 4G).
# Target is the clean URL /en/ (NOT /en/index.html — the .html form gets
# normalized to a 308 by CF Pages pretty-URLs, which broke the rewrite).
# Requires that out/index.html is NOT emitted: keep src/app/page.tsx
# deleted, otherwise the static asset shadows this rewrite.
/ /en/ 200
